  "description": "The Sneak convinces with its outstanding design and elegant features. Highest integration and a striking frame design support both the reduced look and the performance-oriented dynamics of the bike. But the Sneak is more than just a sporty, fast bike: More comfort and intuitive handling is ensured by the straight handlebar. With its great riding feel and fresh colours, this urban fitness bike offers ultimate street style. The quality of the bike is obvious from its low overall weight and high-end components. With their low weight, all models are perfect for commuting and for taking along on buses and trains. The versatile 2x11 SHIMANO CUES groupset always offers the right gearing for a smooth and efficient ride. A featherweight carbon fork and Continental Contact Urban tyres turn the bike into an unbeatable fitness machine for road and gravel. The permissible system weight for this wheel is 130 kg. ¹ approx. 10.9 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for chalk frame, size M, without pedals.",
